{# ---------- Auction Representation ---------- #}
<section class="cc26-wrap cc26-section">
    <article class="cc26-service">
        <img class="cc26-service__img" src="/assets/img/services-auction.jpg" alt="Tony inspecting a coin with a loupe at a show table" loading="lazy" width="1400" height="1050" style="object-position: 40% 50%">
        <div class="cc26-service__body">
            <span class="cc26-badge">By application only</span>
            <h2>Auction Representation</h2>
            <p class="cc26-service__lede">When significant money is on the line, online photography simply isn't enough. Tony attends major auction lot viewings in person and delivers professional, in-hand assessments — helping you decide whether to pass or bid with confidence.</p>
            <div class="cc26-tiers">
                <div class="cc26-tier">
                    <div class="cc26-tier__copy">
                        <h3>Lot Viewing &amp; Opinion Report</h3>
                        <p>In-person lot inspection with a written professional opinion on each piece — condition, eye appeal, value assessment, and a clear pass/bid recommendation.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cc26-tier__price">$150<span>/hr</span><small>2-hour minimum</small></div>
                </div>
                <div class="cc26-tier">
                    <div class="cc26-tier__copy">
                        <h3>Full-Service Bid &amp; Delivery</h3>
                        <p>Complete white-glove service including lot viewing, 1-1 consultation, live bid execution in Cabbage Coins' name, delivery acceptance from the auction house, and insured shipping to you.</p>
                        <p class="cc26-tier__note">If the lot is not won, a 1% fee of the winning hammer price applies.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cc26-tier__price">5%<span> of hammer</span><small>$750 minimum</small></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </article>
</section>

{# ---------- Consignment Program ---------- #}
